{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "A no-mail challenge lets the hero take Item Recovery and Worldforged refund mail",
  "contract": [
    "Ruling: Item Recovery and Worldforged refund mail return the character's own items, which Ascension's",
    "Recovery Service delivered straight to the bags, so a no-mail challenge must let the hero take them.",
    "mod-item-recovery sends both as sender-less GM-stationery mail with ITEM_RECOVERY_MAIL_SUBJECT or",
    "WORLDFORGED_REFUND_MAIL_SUBJECT; the challenge exempted only the Recruit-A-Friend subject, so the take was",
    "refused with \"Your challenge forbids receiving mail.\" Expected: under Bloodbath (challenge 15, NO_MAIL)",
    "CMSG_MAIL_TAKE_ITEM answers MAIL_OK (0) for a Silverleaf in Item Recovery mail and a Mageroyal in",
    "Worldforged refund mail, and both land in the bags. An Earthroot in the same sender-less GM-stationery mail",
    "with another subject (boss loot, challenge rewards) stays refused with MAIL_ERR_INTERNAL_ERROR (6), so",
    "only the subject separates the exempt mail from the refused one."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -8914,
    "y": -133,
    "z": 80.6,
    "o": 0
  },
